@startuml ipc-sequence
title M4: admission replay across connections
actor Operator
participant "Client process" as Client
participant "Host / Pipe connection" as Pipe
participant "Host / Dispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Core / Engine" as Engine
database "JSON store" as Store
Operator -> Client : StartJob (RequestId A)
Client -> Pipe : length + UTF-8 request
Pipe -> Dispatcher : validate and dispatch
group start-request lock
Dispatcher -> Engine : Start(immutable job)
Engine --> Dispatcher : Accepted (RunId R)
Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : remember A, fingerprint, response
end
Dispatcher --> Pipe : admission only
Pipe --> Client : response may be lost
note over Engine
Run continues independently of connection.
Prepare -> Acquire -> Inspect -> Persist
end note
Client -> Pipe : reconnect / resend A
Pipe -> Dispatcher : same ID and typed content
Dispatcher --> Pipe : original Accepted / R
Pipe --> Client : same RunId R
Client -> Pipe : GetStatus (new RequestId)
Pipe -> Engine : read snapshot through dispatcher
Engine --> Pipe : current state / stage
Pipe --> Client : correlated response
Client -> Pipe : CancelRun R (new RequestId)
Pipe -> Engine : explicit cancellation through dispatcher
Engine --> Pipe : Accepted / AlreadyRequested / TooLate
Pipe --> Client : cancellation disposition
note over Engine, Store
Cancellation before Persist prevents storage.
After persistence entry, await the storage outcome.
end note
@enduml
